# Plaster infill: a few darker panels (tuff) and cracked panels on the upper timber storeys
north rows 11-13 cols 4-5 where calcite -> tuff
north rows 15-17 cols 7-8 where calcite -> tuff
north rows 15-17 cols 2-3 where calcite -> cracked_stone_bricks
north rows 11-13 cols 8-9 where calcite -> cracked_stone_bricks
west rows 11-13 cols 6-7 where calcite -> tuff
west rows 15-17 cols 3-4 where calcite -> tuff
west rows 15-17 cols 6-7 where calcite -> cracked_stone_bricks
east rows 11-13 cols 3-4 where calcite -> tuff
east rows 15-17 cols 5-6 where calcite -> cracked_stone_bricks
south rows 11-13 cols 6-7 where calcite -> tuff
south rows 15-17 cols 3-4 where calcite -> tuff
